<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Roblox Parkour AUTO DOUBLE WALLBOOST</Major>
    <Description>Hello! I made this script to make it easier to double wallboost with avg. 70 ms

How to use: Run up to a wall then simply activate (make sure it's big enough)

You can just let this run while you're afk to autofarm points!

Screen resolution: 1920x1080

Enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
